{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a simple task: build a doghouse. But no tools to do it.\u00a0The player's goal right now is to wander, to be aimless. Experience the world in first person, and be a spectator, more than a collaborator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doghouse 3 features a dynamic environment systems, a working clock, and sometimes gameplay. This is a demo for the full game of Doghouse 3, with more features to come. Right now, you can experience dream-like worlds, as well as incomplete architecture of the dying world surrounding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dog deserves the best doghouse. Would you be able to deliver?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097710?t=1760197784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097710?t=1760197784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097710/30c3047026d6d941cfd9c1259c3aec26317e4889/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760197784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097710/30c3047026d6d941cfd9c1259c3aec26317e4889/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760197784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a simple task: build a doghouse. But no tools to do it.\u00a0The player's goal right now is to wander, to be aimless. Experience the world in first person, and be a spectator, more than a collaborator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doghouse 3 features a dynamic environment systems, a working clock, and sometimes gameplay. This is a demo for the full game of Doghouse 3, with more features to come. Right now, you can experience dream-like worlds, as well as incomplete architecture of the dying world surrounding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dog deserves the best doghouse. Wo